% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: sidecar golden. Three delivered pages — a clipped stroke
% bracketed by save/restore and an arc filled in DeviceRGB, then a
% dashed stroke with an image mask delivered twice by copypage and
% showpage — whose concatenated dump the sidecar golden pins.
gsave
  10 10 50 50 rectclip
  0 0 moveto 100 100 lineto stroke
grestore
1 0 0 setrgbcolor
50 50 20 0 360 arc closepath fill
showpage
0.5 setgray [4 2] 0 setdash 2 setlinecap
20 20 moveto 80 20 lineto stroke
2 2 true [2 0 0 2 0 0] <4080> imagemask
copypage
showpage
